; Mazel handle zone fixture. No live DNS.
; Same TXT you add at the registrar later (host = handle local).
;
; When ready, add these records at iwantmyname (host = handle local):
;   kai     TXT   mazel-card=https://mazel.ai/cards/kai mazel-haah=1
;   avery   TXT   mazel-card=https://mazel.ai/cards/avery mazel-haah=1
;   nova    TXT   mazel-card=https://mazel.ai/cards/nova mazel-haah=1
;
$ORIGIN mazel.ai.
$TTL 300

kai     300  IN  TXT  "mazel-card=https://mazel.ai/cards/kai mazel-haah=1"
avery   300  IN  TXT  "mazel-card=https://mazel.ai/cards/avery mazel-haah=1"
nova    300  IN  TXT  "mazel-card=https://mazel.ai/cards/nova mazel-haah=1"
